  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: EXCERPT FROM DIARY
  dialogueLines:
  - '"19 JUNE XXXX... '
  - ... These days I can't help but think but feel that there is someone watching
    us. I'm trying to focus on taking care of the boys, but the thought has been
    bothering me for months.
  - Ever since George has moved away, I can't help but feel anxious for my safety.
    I've been seeing a group of people in black hoodies around the neighbourhood
    everywhere.
  - I've tried to ask the police on advice on what to do, but they told me that the
    evidence is not concrete enough to do something about it.
  - I don't believe them... but as long as the boys remain okay, then I will be okay.
  - Love, Victoria"
